Package: trca
Title: Topological Relational Class Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramina", "Sotoudeh", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "ramina.sotoudeh@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1716-017X"))
    )
Description: Implements Topological Relational Class Analysis ('tRCA'), a
    method for recovering positions, construals, and the relational topology
    among them from attitudinal survey data. 'tRCA' treats survey responses
    as a signed respondent-item bipartite network, embeds respondents and
    items jointly with a signed spectral decomposition, and summarises the
    alignment, opposition, and orthogonality among the recovered positions in
    a signed block density matrix. The package also provides baselines for
    Relational Class Analysis ('RCA'; Goldberg (2011) <doi:10.1086/657976>),
    simulators for canonical topologies, and plotting tools.
